ns from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 that same pair ran 73% of normal on the middle, after January to February sat at 25%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 55% of normal on the middle. Grid 28650 had its driest year in 1976 at 53%.</p>"}
